| `EMAIL_FROM` | **required** | — | Verified sender |
{%- else %}
| (log provider — no env vars; emails written to stdout) | — | — | — |
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

{%- if cookiecutter.enable_billing %}

## Stripe billing

