|---|---|---|---|
| `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` | **required** | — | `sk_live_...` (or `sk_test_...` for testing) |
| `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | **required** | — | `whsec_...` from Stripe Dashboard webhook config |
